Package: com.itsallexb.filesarchiver
Name: FilesArchiver (iOS 12)
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Uncompress and Compress in the Files app on iOS 12, like iOS 13. Extracts zip, 7z, rar, tar, tar.gz, tar.bz2, tar.xz, gz, bz2, xz and more; creates zip, tar.gz or 7z. Settings > Files Archiver.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0), libarchive13 (>= 3.6)
